# Licence

## Sprite artwork

The DawnLike tileset — every sprite packed into `atlas/DawnlikeAtlas0.png` and
`atlas/DawnlikeAtlas1.png` — was created by **DragonDePlatino** and
**DawnBringer** and is released under the
[Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International Licence (CC-BY 4.0)](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Original pack: https://dragondeplatino.itch.io/dawnlike

## This repository

The atlas packing, metadata, autotile resolvers, helper API, example
components, generators and documentation in this repository are released under
the same licence, **CC-BY 4.0**.

## What that means for you

You may use, remix and redistribute all of it — including commercially — as
long as you give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and note any changes
you made.

The minimum attribution to carry in a shipped game (credits screen, README, or
about box):

> Sprite art: **DawnLike** by DragonDePlatino and DawnBringer (CC-BY 4.0) —
> https://dragondeplatino.itch.io/dawnlike
> Atlas and tooling: **dawnlike-atlas** (CC-BY 4.0) —
> https://github.com/lucas-stanford/dawnlike-atlas

